message: "If you use OpenVetAtlas VR in your research, education, or academic work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "OpenVetAtlas VR (oVa): Open-Source Virtual Reality Veterinary Anatomy and Osteology Platform"
abstract: "OpenVetAtlas VR (oVa) is an open-source virtual reality (VR) anatomy and osteology platform developed for Meta Quest devices using Unity (URP) to support three-dimensional learning in veterinary medical education, utilizing 3D digital twins scanned at DijiLab."
